{
  "info": {
    "name": "GST Notice Support — Payments",
    "description": "Phase 5 (EP12) Razorpay payment endpoints: POST /payments/:bookingId/initiate, POST /webhooks/razorpay (Layer 1), GET /payments/verify (Layer 2). Auth: seeded admin login (creds injected at runtime via --env-var). Webhook/redirect signatures are computed in pre-request scripts with CryptoJS using RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET / RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET (injected at runtime, never committed). Requires two draft_ready bookings minted by setup-draft-ready-booking.mjs (injected as draftReadyBookingId / draftReadyBookingId2). The verify \"success\" branch and a real captured webhook need an actually-captured Razorpay test payment (checkout modal) — the synthetic signed webhook here proves the capture→filing→idempotency core instead.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
